SORIX-ILOM-LDOM boot disk
====================

This floppy boots the SORIX-ILOM-LDOM (pvmk) microkernel on an Amiga 3000 (68030/040/060).
Connect the serial port (115200 8N1) to see the boot log.

  pvmk       microkernel image. Do not modify: the boot block loads it
             from fixed blocks. If it was replaced, run pvinstall DF0:
  pvmk.conf  configuration (safe to edit)
